    "type": "game",
    "name": "Muri: Wildwoods",
    "steam_appid": 3284200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/d89ceebb315560be529e73bfb7b572f8.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/6e32394f26011ff1db6ab1ef47c735d7.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/6e32394f26011ff1db6ab1ef47c735d7.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a vivid critter-filled, relaxing cleaning adventure in Muri: Wildwoods! Explore a mysterious island, uncover secrets, befriend cute creatures, clean away corruption, save the island\u2019s forest spirit, and restore the world\u2019s beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/5ebe9a724e344a34c41c76a8b1241aa0.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/5ebe9a724e344a34c41c76a8b1241aa0.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and splash your way through lush but polluted nature. Solve relaxing puzzles with your trusty water gun as you explore the colorful world of Wildwoods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1b3bd901e3e87eef849d70a037be4531.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1016 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1b3bd901e3e87eef849d70a037be4531.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildwoods is full of adorable critters to clean, befriend, and catalogue. Just don\u2019t forget to give them a little pet before you head off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/60193044d1d92e05432479ce1f40ec3d.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/60193044d1d92e05432479ce1f40ec3d.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty watergun and its unlockable nozzles to clean corrupted nature and its critter inhabitants in super satisfying ways. Watch as Wildwoods\u2019 nature restores and its vibrant colors come back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/2542e6a03c6a4c189e391074c0ff1136.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/2542e6a03c6a4c189e391074c0ff1136.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island of Wildwoods is tended by a great forest spirit, the Racoonicorn. Corrupted pollution has overwhelmed the spirit, leaving it unable to fulfill its purpose. Set out on an adventure, accompanied by helpful creatures like the Lizzird, to set the spirit free and restore Wildwoods together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/ea344c2413cd66247480c1944bec9af5.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ items to clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratches that classic platformer itch, but gives you a bit more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of silly secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing cleaning gameplay with accessibility settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the critters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lore in Muri\u2019s sketch book. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI to disturb your immersion in the Muri\u2019s world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/3682dacf1b4f63df7df8b6332b00f574.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1022 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/b4dca39a910fb57194fe2202ebd796b4.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1016 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/d89ceebb315560be529e73bfb7b572f8.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/6e32394f26011ff1db6ab1ef47c735d7.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/6e32394f26011ff1db6ab1ef47c735d7.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into a vivid critter-filled, relaxing cleaning adventure in Muri: Wildwoods! Explore a mysterious island, uncover secrets, befriend cute creatures, clean away corruption, save the island\u2019s forest spirit, and restore the world\u2019s beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/5ebe9a724e344a34c41c76a8b1241aa0.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/5ebe9a724e344a34c41c76a8b1241aa0.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump and splash your way through lush but polluted nature. Solve relaxing puzzles with your trusty water gun as you explore the colorful world of Wildwoods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1b3bd901e3e87eef849d70a037be4531.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1016 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/1b3bd901e3e87eef849d70a037be4531.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wildwoods is full of adorable critters to clean, befriend, and catalogue. Just don\u2019t forget to give them a little pet before you head off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/60193044d1d92e05432479ce1f40ec3d.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/60193044d1d92e05432479ce1f40ec3d.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your trusty watergun and its unlockable nozzles to clean corrupted nature and its critter inhabitants in super satisfying ways. Watch as Wildwoods\u2019 nature restores and its vibrant colors come back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/2542e6a03c6a4c189e391074c0ff1136.poster.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1032 height=445 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/2542e6a03c6a4c189e391074c0ff1136.webm?t=1755161125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island of Wildwoods is tended by a great forest spirit, the Racoonicorn. Corrupted pollution has overwhelmed the spirit, leaving it unable to fulfill its purpose. Set out on an adventure, accompanied by helpful creatures like the Lizzird, to set the spirit free and restore Wildwoods together!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/ea344c2413cd66247480c1944bec9af5.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1128 height=89 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ items to clean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratches that classic platformer itch, but gives you a bit more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of silly secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing cleaning gameplay with accessibility settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can pet the critters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect lore in Muri\u2019s sketch book. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal UI to disturb your immersion in the Muri\u2019s world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/3682dacf1b4f63df7df8b6332b00f574.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1022 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284200/extras/b4dca39a910fb57194fe2202ebd796b4.avif?t=1755161125\" width=1016 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
